   of physicians; documents (PDF and other files); and the architectural
   documentation.

   Personal data of physicians, images and scientific materials belong to their
   respective authors and rights holders and are included in the project on
   separate grounds. This license grants no rights to them.

2. Prohibited without prior written permission of the copyright holder

   - copying, distributing or publishing the project or any part of it;
   - using the project or its parts, including the database and medical
     materials, in your own or third-party products;
   - creating derivative works;
   - any commercial use.

3. No warranty

   The project is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
   implied. In no event shall the copyright holder be liable for any claim,
   damages or other liability arising from or in connection with the project or
   its use.

4. Medical disclaimer

   The materials are provided for reference only and do not constitute medical
   advice, diagnosis or a prescription of treatment.
